igratedFullEntries` | `checkpoint.FlattenTree()` | Remove wrapper; use directly |\n| migrate.go:659–661 | `migratedRawArtifactPaths.matches()` | `agent.ChunkSuffix` | Document assumption; consider utility |\n| migrate.go:548,562 | Commit message strings | None | Define constants for reuse |\n| migrate_test.go (4x) | Temp variable restore | None | Extract test helper |\n\n**Recommended priority:** Fix #1 (updateRef), #5 (test helper), then #4 (constants). #2 and #3 are lower-impact (API consistency vs. scope-specific logic)."}],"totalDurationMs":123923,"totalTokens":43700,"totalToolUseCount":36,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":379,"cache_read_input_tokens":41706,"output_tokens":1615,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":379},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1615,"cache_read_input_tokens":41706,"cache_creation_input_tokens":379,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":379,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":11,"searchCount":0,"bashCount":25,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"34a2ba8d-fa23-409b-abf8-f17e35406331","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/pfleidi/entire/cli/.worktrees/fix/checkpoints-v2-generation-refs-during-migration","sessionId":"e40cf889-38b6-495b-9c29-f29d0a84d6a0","version":"2.1.119","gitBranch":"fix/checkpoints-v2-generation-refs-during-migration"}
